benchmarks/asm/
# Silicon flow build artifacts (regenerate via scripts/synth-soft-core.sh + record-silicon-reports.sh):
# checked-in RTL (*.v), testbenches, hand-written records and reports.json stay tracked; the heavy synth
# intermediates, placed configs (nextpnr --textcfg), FPU hex vectors (verify-fpu.sh), implementation run
# logs, bitstream build recipes, packed bitstreams and sim binaries do not.
benchmarks/silicon/*.json
!benchmarks/silicon/reports.json
benchmarks/silicon/*.config
benchmarks/silicon/fpu_*.hex
benchmarks/silicon/*_impl.log
benchmarks/silicon/*.bit.build.txt
